nd Ohio State all lose in Week 12","description":"UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State all lost to unranked teams in a year where parity is the ever-present theme.","published":"2026-11-22T07:25:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedayfinal112126/week-12-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T14:49:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:48:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5197086/sahir-west","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sahir_West"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Sahir West","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sahir_West","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:28Z","intro":"Sahir West is an American college football defensive lineman for the UCLA Bruins. He previously played for the James Madison Dukes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"West attended Mount Saint Joseph High School in Baltimore, Maryland. As a junior, he totaled 63 tackles, ten sacks, and an interception. Following his high school career, West committed to play college football at James Madison University."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"West played sparingly in 2024, appearing in two games and earning a redshirt. His production increased the following season, recording ten tackles, 5.5 tackles for loss, and three sacks in the 2025 Sun Belt Conference Football Championship Game against Troy. At the conclusion of the regular season, West was named the Sun Belt Freshman of the Year and a first-team Freshman All-American by The Athletic."}]}}